==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|resorbere}}, from {{m|la|re-||again}} + {{m|la|sorbere||to suck in}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} to [[absorb]] (something) again
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} to undergo [[resorption]]
# {{lb|en|biology|transitive}} to [[dissolve]] something (as for example bone, sinew, or suture) and [[assimilate]] it.

